 "answer": "CD-12001: Thank you for reaching out regarding your recent billing issue. I understand that you were charged $240 for the annual renewal of the CloudDesk Team plan 20 days ago, which exceeds the 14-day refund eligibility window specified in the policy. According to the verified facts, charges outside this window are not eligible for refunds. Therefore, we cannot process a refund at this time. However, if you would like to ensure that the next charge does not occur, please follow the steps outlined in the article [MACRO-002]: Turn off automatic renewal in Organization Settings > Billing. This action will prevent the next charge from occurring. If you need further assistance or clarification, feel free to ask.",
